  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/02/IMG_2774.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Est&aacute; abierta desde el lunes 9 de febrero en la calle Ben-Al-Abbar, 24 de Onda, casi en la esquina con la avenida Sierra Espad&aacute;n, junto al colegio Miralcamp y la Secci&oacute;n de Secundaria, para desayunos, almuerzos, comidas y meriendas de lunes a viernes (de 7 a 16 y de 16.30 a 19.30 horas). S&aacute;bado, desayunos y almuerzos (de 7.30 a 12.30 horas).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/cafeteriaeatsy-1.jpg\" alt=\"cafeteriaeatsy-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/cafeteriaeatsy-2.jpg\" alt=\"cafeteriaeatsy-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/img_2728.jpg\" alt=\"img_2728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/img_2729.jpg\" alt=\"img_2729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/img_2730.jpg\" alt=\"img_2730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/img_2732.jpg\" alt=\"img_2732\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/img_2734.jpg\" alt=\"img_2734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/img_2736.jpg\" alt=\"img_2736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteriaeatsyinaug/img_2737.jpg\" alt=